{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "006 Gap Remediation Review",
  "description": "After any file is written inside the 006 project folder, verify it addresses a specific gap from the assessment and follows all architecture rules.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "postToolUse",
    "toolTypes": [
      "write"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "Check if the file just written is inside my-agent-project-006-v1-openclaw-salesforce-aws/. If yes, verify: (1) it addresses a specific PARTIAL/NOT DONE/BROKEN task from docs/006-design-vs-reality-assessment.md, (2) it follows the architecture rules in .kiro/steering/006-gap-remediation.md, (3) no credentials are hardcoded, (4) MNPI fields are not sent to LLM prompts. Report which assessment task this addresses and whether it passes all checks."
  }
}